{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1700092800, "end_date": 1700697599, "month_true_total": 232, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:22:45 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "151171692", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995974086", "personaname": "[+] KennyDangerous", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KennyDangerous/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2999, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1344, "last_played": 1702785105, "avatar": "c054496f06f9fe6604ef1e994db6d4adb92efc94"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you're a fan of the Alien series and like arcadey-type shoot-em-ups, this game is pretty fire. It's up to 3-player co-op with different classes, different abilities, and customization. I do wish the game went a little deeper into the customization, but my brother and I have been loving it so far. They definitely need more content too. Highly suggest picking this up on sale. Solid 7.5/10 with 22 hours in the game.", "timestamp_created": 1700689691, "timestamp_updated": 1700689691, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151171142", "author": {"steamid": "76561198211314117", "personaname": "Reaperraafje", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198211314117/", "num_games_owned": 762, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 6681, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5177, "last_played": 1770587693, "avatar": "0bfd6a007df7f197f6b622848c60547bc3e611a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a fun game to play with friend. You can try a lot of diffrent things and builds in game. I would like to see more updates and more maps.", "timestamp_created": 1700689550, "timestamp_updated": 1700689550, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151163160", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983108525", "personaname": "Edgar Lindner", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197983108525/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 12, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12, "last_played": 1700685247, "avatar": "b645adad697bbf4b5aaa95d4e3cafe398f7f3915"}, "language": "english", "review": "I could not hear the sound of my gun firing, the graphics are bad but it still runs poorly. 1 player leaves as we start the first game and 5 mins later I lost connection to the host. I exited and refunded.\n\nEven in PS3 era this would not be good...oh my...this is bad!", "timestamp_created": 1700687502, "timestamp_updated": 1700687502, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497476816177368164", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151135686", "author": {"steamid": "76561198051383579", "personaname": "UltraWulf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198051383579/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 11428, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9355, "last_played": 1783677267, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has problems to be sure - but for fans of Aliens (1986), this game is a no-brainer. People looking for a horror approach alien game (aka Alien Isolation) should steer clear of Fireteam Elite. This is a horde survival game first and foremost. The campaign is enjoyable though the story could be better. The developers would do good to improve connectivity and I cannot for the life of me understand why it still doesn't have chat available. After the bots update single play has improved drastically. Massacring Alien hordes has never felt this good.", "timestamp_created": 1700681551, "timestamp_updated": 1700681551, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "151124822", "author": {"steamid": "76561198081049544", "personaname": "Ragnar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198081049544/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 156, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 156, "last_played": 1681746570, "avatar": "11db86aeaaf1e00b3fc287185d22e63aa3beb26a"}, "language": "english", "review": "it probably has some value for alien series fans, but for me... nah. It's really boring. Same ugly textures and same predictable encounters with ugly model of xenomorph again and again and again. \nVery basic balistic model and very borning gunplay. \nHowever, some of my friends which are in love with Alien universum told me, that it's awesome game and I just can't understand it. \nSo... try it if it is in sale. \nIt really wouldn't worth for 30€", "timestamp_created": 1700679478, "timestamp_updated": 1700679478, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503117501735687256", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}